"────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
"/archive  Archive this session or a saved one               "
"/clear    Start a new session (this one stays resumable)    "
"/compact  Compress conversation context into a summary      "
"/config   Show resolved config                              "
"/delete   Delete a saved session                            "
"/diff     Show uncommitted working-tree changes             "
"/effort   Adjust reasoning effort                           "
"/exit     Quit ox                                           "
